WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:06.923
"ASL Gloss" is ASL documentation.

00:00:06.923 --> 00:00:10.844
How do you put this 3D sign...

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:12.387
How do you put this 3D sign... on paper?

00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:24.899
You use placeholder words

00:00:24.899 --> 00:00:30.155
to help you remember what you signed to say that line.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:51.342
It has so many different layers

00:00:51.342 --> 00:00:54.804
that are incorporated in the language.

00:00:54.804 --> 00:00:56.598
It has a virtuosity.

